# --- raw shoot assets -------------------------------------------------------
# The repo carries CODE and the DERIVED web assets (src/assets/img, public/video).
# Camera masters and working files stay out — they run well over 1GB and nothing
# in the build reads them at deploy time; only the scripts in tools/ do.
#
# Keep these on the drive next to the repo if you need to re-run
# tools/encode-hero.sh, tools/encode-pour.sh or tools/prep-images.sh.
#
# NOTE: these are anchored with a leading slash on purpose. Unanchored, a rule
# like `coffee.jpg` would also swallow src/assets/img/coffee.jpg, which IS meant
# to be tracked.
/HEROREEL*.mov
/reel for mobile hero.mp4
/GradedShots*.mov
/Assorted Images/
/cake grid images/
/all cake images/
/MENUS/
/Extra Images/
/cake delivery images/
/new_logo.PNG
/vanessa-visit-checklist.pdf
/cafecito.jpg
/coffee.jpg
/coffee2.jpg
/coffee*.psd
/chocostrawberry_removebg.png
/pandulcesign.jpg
/pattingbread.jpg
/sign.jpg
# superseded 692px copy of the portrait kept below
/IMG_1183_edited.jpg.avif

# Exception, deliberately tracked: Vanessa's portrait at full resolution, pulled
# off the Wix media server before that site is decommissioned. It is 0.7MB, it is
# not reproducible once the old site goes away, and it is not yet used on any
# page. Do not "tidy" this out of the repo.

# Kept on this machine only, never in the (public) repo: project notes with
